        {"t": [3], "es": "Holmes"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "line": [
        {"t": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "es": "«Me gustaría que viniera a alojarse"},
        {"t": [7, 8, 9], "es": "en Holdernesse Hall,"},
        {"t": [10, 11], "es": "señor Holmes»."}
      ],
      "words": [
        {"t": [0, 1], "es": "me gustaría", "base": "would like", "sense": "want", "note": "*I’d* es aquí *I would* ([[contractions]]). *Would like* expresa un deseo de forma cortés."},
        {"t": [2], "es": "usted", "note": "El sujeto del infinitivo va delante de *to*: *I’d like you to…* equivale a «Me gustaría que usted…» ([[object-infinitive]])."},
